# The Battle of Xarcabard (WotG 30), the whole run, in Xarcabard [S]. The login at Status 0 plays the zone-in 17, left
# open; its finish sets Status 1. Rally Point: Red plays 18 [0, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1]; its finish completes the mission
# (Prelude to a Storm current).
lists XarcabardS/onZoneIn/1 XarcabardS/Rally_Point_Red/onTrigger XarcabardS/onEventFinish/17 XarcabardS/onEventFinish/18
char zone=XarcabardS pos=-106.071,-25.5,-50 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg TheBattleOfXarcabard current
login open                                 # 17
finish                                     # Status 1
trigger Rally_Point_Red                    # 18
finish                                     # completed
